        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hello @Irubataru,\n\nThanks for the issue. I can reproduce.\n\nThis happens because the full path becomes the name of the buffer when opened by the snacks picker. The following does work in that case: `:Git show main:%:t`, see `:h filename-modifiers`\n\nYou can reproduce this in your terminal: `git show main:/home/my_user/my_project/some_dir/somefile.cpp`, and the error will be the same.\n\nNote that the previous command without `main:` does work. So, I assume that show expects a relative path when the path is prepended with the name of a branch.",
